WEBVTT

02:10.160 --> 02:12.520
Gates of hell, open!

02:29.480 --> 02:30.480
Thank you so much, priest.

02:30.560 --> 02:34.280
The pits of hell have broken open,
yet the High Heavens show mercy.

02:34.360 --> 02:35.760
The dead have crossed the dark ford

02:35.840 --> 02:37.560
and escaped
the suffering of reincarnation.

02:40.600 --> 02:41.440
I'll take my leave.

02:50.720 --> 02:52.160
Tomorrow is the funeral.

02:52.880 --> 02:55.600
Have my son's comrades and friends
been informed?

02:56.120 --> 02:57.640
Everyone has been notified.

02:57.720 --> 02:59.120
Don't worry, Uncle.

03:00.120 --> 03:01.560
It's such a pity he passed like this.

03:02.080 --> 03:04.800
We should let all his friends
come and send him off.

03:21.760 --> 03:22.960
When a man dies,

03:23.880 --> 03:25.360
how many come to see him off

03:26.600 --> 03:28.000
depends on whether it rains that day,

03:28.080 --> 03:29.080
doesn't it?

03:40.360 --> 03:43.320
WINE SHOP

04:43.080 --> 04:44.320
Show your travel pass.

04:47.120 --> 04:48.480
Here you go, sir.

04:48.560 --> 04:49.600
Stop.

04:50.600 --> 04:51.960
Do you have a travel pass?

04:52.960 --> 04:53.800
I…

04:55.400 --> 04:56.240
I lost it.

04:56.320 --> 04:57.760
So you don't have one.

04:57.840 --> 04:59.160
No pass, no leaving the city.

05:01.160 --> 05:03.040
Right, what's your name?

05:04.160 --> 05:05.240
I'm talking to you.

05:07.400 --> 05:08.360
I…

05:09.440 --> 05:10.960
I'm Zhang Mo.

05:12.360 --> 05:13.360
Where are you from?

05:15.440 --> 05:16.320
Huzhou.

05:17.080 --> 05:18.440
Huzhou Rear Command Office

05:19.040 --> 05:20.600
should be around Little Yamen Street.

05:21.800 --> 05:22.840
Hurry and get a replacement.

05:22.920 --> 05:25.280
Don't delay your trip.
You'll only make your family worry.

05:33.160 --> 05:34.920
-Roasted goose on sale!.
-Okay.

05:36.120 --> 05:37.560
Charms for sale!

05:39.520 --> 05:40.680
Smells wonderful.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.240
‎FUZE INN

05:50.120 --> 05:52.400
-Stop running.
-Here, take this over to the gentleman.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.720
Wait for me.

06:04.800 --> 06:06.120
Watch where you're going.

07:08.960 --> 07:09.840
Where's the dog?

07:10.960 --> 07:12.960
Someone's watching him. He'll be fine.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.560
About Mo…

07:20.960 --> 07:22.840
I've sent a letter to Huzhou.

07:23.640 --> 07:26.040
His wife and children
will be taken care of.

07:26.120 --> 07:27.360
Don't worry.

07:28.440 --> 07:29.320
No.

07:31.160 --> 07:34.240
Just tell them
his business in Chang'an is doing well,

07:34.320 --> 07:36.400
and he needs to stay longer.

07:38.720 --> 07:41.320
He's doing it for the sake of the family.

07:48.280 --> 07:49.600
Are you worried

07:49.680 --> 07:51.320
his family will be upset?

07:55.440 --> 07:57.160
Nothing that happened here

07:58.480 --> 08:00.120
can be leaked.

08:02.720 --> 08:03.760
You just won't admit it.

08:18.440 --> 08:19.880
THE UNDERTAKER

08:19.960 --> 08:20.960
Look at him.

08:21.040 --> 08:22.840
Why is he out dressed like this?

08:22.920 --> 08:25.160
It's broad daylight. What an eyesore.

08:27.080 --> 08:29.160
JINHUA TAVERN

08:42.039 --> 08:44.640
There's something you can't see or touch,

08:45.640 --> 08:47.320
but it exists between us.

08:48.400 --> 08:50.880
Guess what it is?

08:55.760 --> 08:58.680
There's something you can't see or touch,

08:59.720 --> 09:01.800
but it exists between us.

09:03.160 --> 09:05.560
Guess what it is?

09:11.520 --> 09:13.040
-Come on.
-Let's drink.

09:14.920 --> 09:17.040
SPRING ALE

09:19.200 --> 09:20.240
What bad luck.

09:23.760 --> 09:24.760
A pot of liquor, please.

09:34.040 --> 09:35.440
How many times have I told you?

09:36.040 --> 09:37.680
Don't wear funeral robes in here.

09:37.760 --> 09:39.120
You earn me a pot of liquor

09:39.200 --> 09:41.720
and cost me half a day's business.

09:41.800 --> 09:43.120
Don't be so superstitious.

09:44.400 --> 09:46.200
Who hasn't had a funeral in the family?

09:46.280 --> 09:47.800
Right here,

09:48.320 --> 09:50.080
from Caomen Street to Pingkang Ward.

09:50.160 --> 09:51.080
I've sent off

09:52.200 --> 09:54.200
many people who lived there.

09:54.720 --> 09:55.920
What's wrong with this fellow?

10:05.640 --> 10:07.480
Who knows,

10:08.320 --> 10:09.640
I might be working for you tomorrow.

10:09.720 --> 10:10.560
Bah.

10:10.640 --> 10:12.560
-Touch wood.
-What nonsense are you spouting?

10:13.080 --> 10:14.360
-Don't go.
-What bad luck!

10:14.440 --> 10:15.600
Let's drink somewhere else.

10:15.680 --> 10:17.040
You serve him then.

10:20.920 --> 10:24.440
There's something you can't see or touch,

10:25.240 --> 10:27.280
but it exists between us.

10:28.640 --> 10:30.120
Guess what it is?

10:32.200 --> 10:34.680
Hatred. Finish the liquor and get out.

10:36.720 --> 10:38.000
Don't, Jinhua.

10:38.080 --> 10:39.520
I come here every day.

10:39.600 --> 10:41.040
Can't you show me a kinder face?

10:41.120 --> 10:42.960
Just smile at me once.

10:43.600 --> 10:44.920
Hua!

10:56.360 --> 10:59.800
There's something you can't see or touch,

11:00.920 --> 11:03.480
but it exists between us.

11:04.440 --> 11:06.800
Guess what it is?

11:17.880 --> 11:19.000
Karmic debt, I suppose.

11:24.320 --> 11:25.280
It is.

11:32.960 --> 11:34.280
Before we return to the Capital,

11:34.360 --> 11:35.960
the blades and men you asked for

11:36.800 --> 11:38.240
are ready.

11:38.960 --> 11:40.240
We await your command.

11:44.680 --> 11:46.200
Liu Ziyan has appeared.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.560
Finally showed himself.

11:52.960 --> 11:53.880
Is he alive or dead?

11:55.840 --> 11:56.920
Dead.

11:58.360 --> 11:59.360
We don't take the living.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.840
You're cruel.

12:04.560 --> 12:05.680
He was your uncle.

12:08.800 --> 12:10.720
A diviner read my fortune.

12:11.640 --> 12:13.120
He said

12:13.920 --> 12:15.600
that after I turned 12,

12:16.560 --> 12:17.640
I'd cut ties with all my kin.

12:20.640 --> 12:21.560
That's easy then.

12:22.280 --> 12:23.840
There's no one I can't send off.

12:26.720 --> 12:28.760
He's Huben's top killer.

12:29.920 --> 12:31.000
Don't get careless.

12:31.080 --> 12:33.240
Huben's top fool.

12:35.000 --> 12:37.040
Say something light. And smile for once.

12:37.640 --> 12:39.040
Don't always keep your face so tense.

12:39.560 --> 12:41.400
You look more like an undertaker

12:41.480 --> 12:42.560
than I do.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.560
Tonight,

12:45.080 --> 12:47.040
do a ritual for me.

12:47.640 --> 12:49.760
You know where to find me.

12:55.480 --> 12:57.080
Is this part of the plan?

12:57.160 --> 12:58.400
No, it's not.

13:20.280 --> 13:22.760
INCENSES AND CANDLES

13:24.120 --> 13:25.680
Lots of deaths this month.
Business is good.

13:25.760 --> 13:27.720
Look. We made quite a lot.

13:35.360 --> 13:37.080
Put these gold ingots

13:37.880 --> 13:39.440
outside each of our buddies' doors.

13:40.040 --> 13:42.760
It was a promise I made to them.

13:42.840 --> 13:44.280
I believe they haven't forgotten.

13:44.880 --> 13:45.840
Also,

13:45.920 --> 13:48.240
divide the earnings
from these past few years

13:48.840 --> 13:50.880
among their families.

13:50.960 --> 13:51.960
Sir.

13:55.880 --> 13:57.120
It's nothing.

13:57.720 --> 13:59.360
We make our living off the dead.

14:00.440 --> 14:01.680
So every once in a while,

14:01.760 --> 14:03.800
we have to spend it all.

14:05.040 --> 14:06.160
Otherwise,

14:07.480 --> 14:08.920
bad luck will come for us.

14:14.360 --> 14:15.640
Get it done tonight.

14:16.800 --> 14:17.920
Don't forget.

14:34.920 --> 14:36.800
THE UNDERTAKER

14:36.880 --> 14:40.280
PU NICHUAN

14:53.800 --> 14:55.400
General Fengshan said

14:56.960 --> 14:58.280
you were once taken captive.

14:59.320 --> 15:01.640
He asked me to leave you here in Tiemo.

15:02.320 --> 15:03.960
It's a troubled time.

15:05.240 --> 15:06.600
Everyone is displaced and suffering.

15:11.200 --> 15:12.480
You go first.

15:18.360 --> 15:19.680
Wait for me down there.

15:21.360 --> 15:23.320
Huben's top fool.

15:39.080 --> 15:41.920
When it comes to gathering intel
and tracking people down,

15:43.280 --> 15:48.720
I suppose my men are better than yours,

15:49.240 --> 15:51.480
who only know how to swing their swords.

16:00.120 --> 16:01.520
If I were you,

16:02.240 --> 16:03.680
with a voice that hoarse,

16:04.200 --> 16:05.560
I'd talk less nonsense.

16:09.520 --> 16:11.040
My men say

16:11.120 --> 16:12.960
there's a physician in Tangshui Alley

16:13.800 --> 16:15.800
who fled with his whole family
a few days ago.

16:15.880 --> 16:19.320
Word has it he treated a great swordsman.

16:19.920 --> 16:22.120
Someone with decent skills

16:23.240 --> 16:25.560
managed to abduct the deposed emperor
at a critical moment.

16:26.160 --> 16:27.960
Apparently, someone orchestrated it.

16:28.040 --> 16:29.800
Have you found the person behind it?

16:31.360 --> 16:35.760
The mastermind
is clever and deeply hidden.

16:37.080 --> 16:38.600
I'm ashamed to say

16:40.080 --> 16:41.680
I haven't found them yet.

16:47.040 --> 16:48.520
Ziyan,

16:49.120 --> 16:50.760
I came all the way to bring you this news,

16:50.840 --> 16:53.000
yet you won't even offer me a cup of tea.

17:05.440 --> 17:08.319
But there's one thing
you might find interesting.

17:10.839 --> 17:11.720
Go on.

17:15.960 --> 17:17.920
Your old residence hasn't been sold yet.

17:25.640 --> 17:26.599
The deed

17:26.680 --> 17:29.440
is in the hands of a merchant
named Yang Chuhao.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.440
He claims to be a merchant,

17:31.960 --> 17:34.360
but in truth,
he secretly handles asset sales

17:34.440 --> 17:35.560
for the royals.

17:36.080 --> 17:38.240
Too many people died in that house.

17:38.320 --> 17:39.880
It's been abandoned for years.

17:41.840 --> 17:43.560
If you don't mind,

17:44.240 --> 17:45.640
you can move back in.

18:17.720 --> 18:20.680
Has this blade killed before?

18:24.040 --> 18:25.400
Sir,

18:25.920 --> 18:28.000
you must have been
a great help to this household.

18:56.560 --> 18:58.280
On your 10th birthday,

18:59.040 --> 19:00.400
I prepared a pair of shoes,

19:01.200 --> 19:04.160
wishing you a smooth road ahead.

19:06.880 --> 19:09.280
MEMORIAL TABLET OF LATE BROTHER, ZHANG MO

19:21.880 --> 19:24.760
You're not a sentimental person.

19:25.360 --> 19:26.840
A pageboy dies,

19:27.640 --> 19:29.560
and you'd hold a ritual for him?

19:31.640 --> 19:33.000
On this path,

19:33.080 --> 19:34.960
I've had no pity
for the many who lost their lives.

19:36.640 --> 19:38.360
But Mo was innocent.

19:39.200 --> 19:42.520
One innocent death is one too many.

19:44.160 --> 19:45.360
Sounds like

19:46.120 --> 19:47.680
I'm not innocent.

19:49.120 --> 19:50.600
You're not.

19:51.120 --> 19:52.680
But you may not die.

19:54.560 --> 19:56.320
Maybe just get badly injured.

19:56.400 --> 19:57.600
Anyway, don't worry.

19:58.120 --> 19:59.640
I have good physicians.

20:02.360 --> 20:04.840
Then I should thank you. How considerate.

20:07.080 --> 20:08.200
Do you have time?

20:10.200 --> 20:11.160
Yes.

20:11.920 --> 20:13.960
Let's find somewhere nice
and have a drink.

20:16.320 --> 20:17.960
Madam, a pot of liquor, please.

20:18.640 --> 20:19.760
Alright.

20:19.840 --> 20:21.200
I haven't seen you in a while.

20:21.280 --> 20:23.240
-Tonight we drink our fill.
-We will indeed.

20:23.320 --> 20:24.360
With your stomach for wine?

20:25.920 --> 20:26.920
-Enjoy your drink.
-Come on.

20:27.000 --> 20:27.960
Enjoy.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.200
Fill it up.

20:32.320 --> 20:33.560
Speaking of which,

20:34.080 --> 20:36.160
what do you care about most in this life?

20:36.800 --> 20:38.480
Getting justice for the dead.

20:40.360 --> 20:41.200
That's it?

20:42.200 --> 20:43.640
Besides that,

20:44.640 --> 20:45.840
is there anything else

20:45.920 --> 20:46.840
that matters to you?

20:48.080 --> 20:49.720
I will kill my enemy

20:50.320 --> 20:51.960
with my own hands.

20:55.480 --> 20:57.360
Isn't that still revenge?

20:58.120 --> 20:59.760
Is that all you ever think about?

21:01.720 --> 21:03.480
You see,

21:03.560 --> 21:05.040
life can be beautiful.

21:06.320 --> 21:07.760
A lantern swaying in the wind.

21:08.440 --> 21:09.560
A carriage passing by.

21:12.360 --> 21:14.120
The scent of liquor drifting over.

21:18.200 --> 21:20.880
And the tavern owner, right?

21:27.560 --> 21:29.920
She's nice,

21:30.000 --> 21:32.200
but not to you.

21:32.280 --> 21:34.640
Maybe she just doesn't understand you.

21:35.960 --> 21:37.560
You seem to know quite a lot.

21:37.640 --> 21:39.600
Isn't your head full of revenge?

21:42.520 --> 21:43.560
I don't understand,

21:45.640 --> 21:47.120
but I have my own attachments too.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.080
Thanks.

22:01.000 --> 22:02.560
Attachments.

22:02.640 --> 22:03.840
Attachments.

22:05.680 --> 22:09.440
Nothing weighs heavier.

22:11.600 --> 22:13.400
You can't cut them off.

22:14.520 --> 22:17.680
That's why
I come here every day for liquor.

22:19.800 --> 22:22.600
But I haven't once seen her smile.

22:31.800 --> 22:32.920
Wait here.

22:34.160 --> 22:36.080
Madam, a plate of meat, please.

22:36.160 --> 22:37.360
Coming.

22:39.800 --> 22:40.640
Here you go.

22:41.840 --> 22:42.880
Madam.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.960
What did you say to her?
What did you say to her?

23:29.040 --> 23:30.440
She smiled at me, you know?

23:31.320 --> 23:32.240
Tell me.

23:32.320 --> 23:34.000
Once tonight's task is done,

23:34.080 --> 23:35.240
I'll tell you.

23:36.400 --> 23:37.280
Tell me now.

23:47.280 --> 23:49.440
ALL-GOODS SHOP

25:18.160 --> 25:20.040
Tonight, you'll attack Liu Ziyan's men

25:21.320 --> 25:22.600
and leave clues

25:23.280 --> 25:24.640
to make them follow you.

25:40.120 --> 25:40.960
Sir.

25:48.680 --> 25:49.880
This isn't human blood.

25:51.920 --> 25:53.240
He wants us to find him.

26:24.360 --> 26:25.560
Go inform Mr. Liu.

26:29.600 --> 26:31.480
Sir, we've tracked him.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.880
You didn't track him.

26:35.880 --> 26:37.880
They've been ready for us.

26:44.120 --> 26:44.960
Let's go.

26:46.200 --> 26:47.960
I'd like to see for myself

26:49.120 --> 26:51.360
whether he's a man or a ghost.

27:00.640 --> 27:03.160
An old acquaintance of mine will meet you.

27:12.400 --> 27:13.800
Tonight's plan

27:14.360 --> 27:16.080
is to bring them together

27:16.600 --> 27:18.480
and settle the old debt.

27:26.880 --> 27:29.800
CLOTH, SWEETS

29:39.200 --> 29:40.480
They are also Huben guards!

30:18.120 --> 30:19.240
Where's the dog?

30:19.840 --> 30:21.080
From his position,

30:21.920 --> 30:23.480
he sees more clearly than we do.

30:42.320 --> 30:43.560
Get up.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.800
I'm taking you somewhere.

30:45.840 --> 30:47.080
Ye Zheng.

30:49.440 --> 30:51.920
I… I'll go back with you.

32:04.840 --> 32:06.680
Quick to reincarnate, are you?

32:09.600 --> 32:10.480
Chuan.

32:20.800 --> 32:22.920
I did not merely survive.

32:26.120 --> 32:27.520
I've come to take your life.

33:05.880 --> 33:08.400
Huben's top fool, Liu Ziyan.

33:08.480 --> 33:09.920
You finally got what's coming to you.

33:14.760 --> 33:16.600
I crawled back from hell

33:17.760 --> 33:19.400
for this moment.

33:29.400 --> 33:30.920
You already escaped.

33:32.400 --> 33:33.920
Why come back to this troubled world

33:35.720 --> 33:37.960
and throw yourself into this mess again?

34:18.679 --> 34:21.480
So it was you, you rascal.

35:22.840 --> 35:24.000
See?

35:26.560 --> 35:28.360
This is what happens
when you go against me.

35:34.400 --> 35:35.560
From now on,

35:36.800 --> 35:38.040
I'm willing to

35:39.320 --> 35:40.400
be a slave, a dog.

36:15.800 --> 36:17.600
You didn't drink the liquor I gave you.

36:20.840 --> 36:21.760
After all,

36:24.800 --> 36:26.760
you were involved in my father's murder.

36:33.280 --> 36:35.000
Yet you saved my life.

36:37.080 --> 36:38.240
I can't repay you

36:39.320 --> 36:40.800
in this lifetime.

36:43.120 --> 36:44.640
I'll repay that in the next.

37:45.760 --> 37:46.800
We're even.

37:49.080 --> 37:50.680
But the promise I made to you,

37:53.560 --> 37:54.640
I never fulfilled.

38:01.440 --> 38:02.480
All my life,

38:04.640 --> 38:06.480
I've been caught in hatred.

38:08.320 --> 38:09.760
And now that I'm old…

38:12.320 --> 38:14.240
Don't repeat my mistakes.

38:15.920 --> 38:17.080
There really are

38:18.120 --> 38:19.800
many beautiful things

38:20.680 --> 38:22.000
in this world.

38:24.560 --> 38:26.040
Lanterns swaying in the wind,

38:27.480 --> 38:28.880
carriages passing by,

38:31.720 --> 38:33.240
and the scent of liquor

38:34.040 --> 38:35.840
from a small tavern.

38:43.440 --> 38:44.560
Enough talking.

38:48.400 --> 38:49.840
You haven't told me

38:51.920 --> 38:53.760
what you said

38:54.600 --> 38:55.800
to the tavern owner.

38:56.840 --> 39:00.120
She actually smiled at me.

39:03.840 --> 39:04.920
Tell me.

39:13.360 --> 39:14.320
I told her

39:15.520 --> 39:17.120
there's something

39:18.120 --> 39:19.760
you can't see or touch,

39:21.520 --> 39:22.840
but it exists between you and her.

39:24.880 --> 39:26.160
It's fate.

39:30.320 --> 39:31.320
Her smile

39:33.240 --> 39:34.440
was so beautiful.

39:35.200 --> 39:36.240
Her smile

39:37.560 --> 39:38.480
was

39:39.640 --> 39:40.680
so beautiful.
